description=Zygisk device spoofer targeting TikTok + Grab Passenger. v1.2.4: CRITICAL FIX — generate $MODPATH/system.prop so Magisk applies spoofed Build.* props BEFORE zygote caches them (root cause of Build.MANUFACTURER/MODEL/FINGERPRINT still showing the real device in fingerprint apps). system.prop is refreshed every boot in post-fs-data.sh and best-effort at install time in customize.sh. v1.2.3: fix lsplant.hpp/shadowhook.h included inside ternak_tt::java_hooks namespace (undefined symbol on newer LSPlant AAR). v1.2.2: fix build.sh copy_shadowhook_so pointing at v1.1.9 build tree. v1.2.1: removed -fno-exceptions for try/catch. v1.2.0: ShadowHook + lsplant via prebuilt AAR from Maven Central. Works on Zygisk-Next / HMA-OSS, KernelSU + LSPosed, Android 12-16.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ilham311/Tt/main/update.json
